(
K13 (2026-10-06): full Mohr-Coulomb direct cut-off (phi 0.5, c 0, tension
cap 1) of a plane-strain shear + compression state (E 1, nu 0.25):
sigxy 2.4e-3 -> 0.767081e-3. The cut is stored as the plastic strain
C^-1 (sig_trial - sig): eppxx = eppyy -8.22978456e-6, eppzz
3.29191382e-5 (= Professional 02-08-2026) and the TENSOR shear component
eppxy = dsigxy / 2G = 2.04114892e-3 (the Professional stores dsigxy / G
= 4.08229785e-3, twice the tensor value: deliberate divergence, the GNU
keeps sig = C (eps - eps_p)); f 0. GNU before K13: epp 0, f -1e10.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_elasti
materi_strain_plasti
materi_plasti_f
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.25
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul_direct 0 0.5 0. 0.
group_materi_plasti_tension_direct 0 1.
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx
bounda_time 0 0 0 1 0.0 100 0.0
bounda_dof 1 1 -vely
bounda_time 1 0 0 1 0.0 100 0.0
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx
bounda_time 2 0 0 1 -0.001 100 -0.001
bounda_dof 3 2 -vely
bounda_time 3 0 0 1 0.003 100 0.003
bounda_dof 4 3 -velx
bounda_time 4 0 0 1 0.003 100 0.003
bounda_dof 5 3 -vely
bounda_time 5 0 0 1 -0.001 100 -0.001
bounda_dof 6 4 -velx
bounda_time 6 0 0 1 0.002 100 0.002
bounda_dof 7 4 -vely
bounda_time 7 0 0 1 0.002 100 0.002
control_timestep 0 1.0 1.
target_item 0 -node_dof 1 -eppxx
target_value 0 -8.22978456e-06 1.e-13
target_item 1 -node_dof 1 -eppzz
target_value 1 3.29191382e-05 1.e-13
target_item 2 -node_dof 1 -eppxy
target_value 2 2.04114892e-03 1.e-11
target_item 3 -node_dof 1 -epexx
